#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "These magickal trucker pills have kicked in and you feel great!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You shouldn't have taken this many pills.  Your skin flushes and your nerves "
"feel like they are on fire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your heartbeat doesn't feel normal.  Why on earth did you take more of these "
"pills?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"This might just be it, the big one.  With no hospital available you're just "
"going to have to ride it straight through Hell."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"These magickal trucker pills have worn off and you feel rough.  It might be "
"best to go ahead and sleep through the hangover as best you can."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Aside from any leftover pain and damage that was done to your body by "
"overdosing your feeling pretty good now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your heartbeat slows into a somewhat normal rhythm but your skin is still on "
"fire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Energized, Enflamed, Arrhythmic,
#. Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"The pain in your chest subsides but your heart is still beating in a "
"concerning fashion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Energized, Enflamed,
#. Arrhythmic, Tachycardiac"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Patient has dangerous levels of multiple chemicals in their blood.  Sedation "
"and restraint suggested."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "cheval_withdrawal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Patient has multiple byproducts in blood stream suggesting extended drug "
"binge."
msgstr ""

